## Program Learning Outcomes

Students completing this program will be able to:

- Apply biblical and theological principles to Christian leadership.
- Demonstrate advanced knowledge of servant leadership.
- Develop Spirit-led leadership and ministry strategies.
- Understand organizational leadership and church administration.
- Equip and mentor Christian leaders for effective ministry.
- Integrate Pentecostal–Charismatic spirituality into leadership practices.
